	"note": "refine.yml as RefineDatabase loads it. group is the refine type: Armor, Weapon, Shadow_Armor or Shadow_Weapon. level is the item's armor level or weapon level (1 for shadow gear). Each refine level has bonus and random_bonus in hundredths, as s_refine_level_info; status_calc_pc adds bonus / 100 to weapon ATK and bonus to the refine DEF sum, and random_bonus / 100 is the overrefine maximum. normal is the Normal cost type of the refine level, and is absent when the level has no Normal chance. Its rate is the success chance out of 10000, price is the zeny it costs, material is the AegisName of the ore it takes, and breaking_rate is the chance out of 10000 that a failure breaks the item. The cost of refining an item from +r to +r+1 is the normal of refine level r+1, as findLevelInfo reads it. An item at max_refine cannot be refined. Other cost types are left out. A refine level the file does not list has no entry.",
